the salty caramel rice krispies treat  was our first original recipe we love it  because it's caramel e it's gooey it's  light and it's delicious I'm Natalie  Potter and I'm Laura Potter and we're  the mother/daughter duo behind the  online rice krispie treat companies  listen Baker to start you're going to  prepare a pan with parchment paper and  we also sprinkle a tablespoon of sugar  on the bottom to prevent it from  sticking when you're making rice  krispies treats you're going to want to  use a nonstick pot you'll thank us later  for this when you're cleaning up the  nonstick is a total time-saver we prefer  to use salted butter because it adds  another depth of flavor I love rice  krispies treats because I believe they  are the best dessert on the entire  planet I think they're really nostalgic  it just seems like everybody enjoys them  we're gonna let all this cook for a few  minutes and you can tell it's done when  it can coat the back of your spoon  should take about five minutes reduce  the heat to low and add the mini  marshmallows we prefer to use mini  marshmallows over the larger ones  because they melt super fast and evenly  now we're gonna stir the marshmallows  together until they have completely  melted now that the pot is off the heat  it's time to add the rice cereal it's  really important that you fold in the  cereal to keep it from getting crushed  otherwise it can lead to a dense treat  and what we're really looking for is  something light and airy and chewy I  wish you guys could smell this it smells  so so good when you're smoothing out the  edges of the mixture be careful not to  press down too much so you can keep it  really light then you'll sprinkle flaky  sea salt on the top now the waiting game  I know you really want to eat these but  they're gonna take about an hour at room  temperature or if you're really excited  you could pop them in the fridge for  about 30 minutes I love getting to work  with my mom I'm just so grateful to have  this special relationship and have all  these new experiences and reach our  goals together we really hope that  people try this recipe and use these  tips to take their crispy game to the  next level we fully believe that  handmade treats have this magical power  to show people you love them and make  them happy  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  [Music]  Oh oh yes  [Music]
 

